up <i><strong>Claw Hammer Construction</strong></i> to upgrade the your kitchen and caf\u00e9 floor space, unlock upgrades and features, and purchase new materials to decorate with!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2103110/extras/4919aff79095f91560e7b27116680d19.avif?t=1749167915\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2103110/extras/f4d483a5fc756683254290f0cda5bb60.poster.avif?t=1749167915\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2103110/extras/f4d483a5fc756683254290f0cda5bb60.webm?t=1749167915\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2103110/extras/f4d483a5fc756683254290f0cda5bb60.mp4?t=1749167915\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover over 60 unique ingredients, and find the best combinations to maximise flavour AND profit, while creating your very own menus!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Master ingredients, and unlock their full potential!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Craft the perfect purrsonalised sandwiches to make friendships for life!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2103110/extras/843e4344e4d31b03c6e999a5706e73a6.avif?t=1749167915\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hire your very own staff, and train them to greatness.. or your very specific need!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Want a chef that will make every last sandwich complete perfection, or that can smash out five plates in the same time? A waiter with the purrfect personality to rake in the tips, or ligh